astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O-gc2Lym4ZUQ7kNvwGox3EU&_nc_oc=Adke7_VBeJxKHtACSINX1J83v91RrEam6SJEZvhu-GeN-_eZOTfN94IGY_ZM1dgzfKY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuirkDNIxEOxumymt101N-Ne7AjDg2BjORqmXoBO8zlyw&oe=69998F73"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Wa65ed4HQsQ7kNvwHvNN7b&_nc_oc=AdnelGdjxOoiLLgqpk8umTS_vIg1Qlc25s4g0srIoaLm0Ol1RGDKCDChd52Aq6IeAgs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsmiG3qcHrMm7rKjW6rX4KsXwQWcqSym_IxJ03S2NL1MQ&oe=69999016"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7zF-jgFYkIQQ7kNvwHlxqjM&_nc_oc=AdnO13nLJRMM1ekbdpVP4xOjamMtPfvjDoJjDg110vhdulyaJlx5J5AkViQ-kg8WDFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvEkjang2bJ4lJejpT0Zg_1DU0pdmphSkBW22W-U5rPUg&oe=6999AEBD"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip